## Inherited decisions

- Keep lazy injection after blocked `edit/write`.
- Remove mandatory exact `read`.
- No proactive injection on arbitrary `read`.
- Accept first wasted diff.
- Applied scoped mutations require matching rules visible in the request that generated the mutation.
